@startuml ROPC_Flow
autonumber
actor Usuario
participant "Cliente OAuth (Legacy)" as Client
participant "Servidor de Autorización" as AS
participant "Servidor de Recursos" as RS

Usuario -> Client: Ingresa usuario y contraseña
Client -> AS: POST /oauth/token (grant_type=password, username, password)
AS -> AS: Valida cliente, hash de contraseña y scopes
AS --> Client: 200 OK (access_token JWT)
Client -> RS: GET /api/me (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
RS -> RS: Valida firma JWT y scope (profile.read)
RS --> Client: 200 OK (Datos del usuario)
@enduml